{{PAGENAME}} is a [[Curiosity]] which can be used in the [[Study Report]] to earn [[Learning Points]] and is a two-handed weapon that can be used for melee combat.

==How to Acquire==

Collect tusk from carcass after butchering an [[Narwhal]] corpse.

==Quality==

* Equal to the Narwhal itself, [[softcap]]ped by [[Survival]].
* Damage scales with strength and weapon quality using the following formula: <math>Damage = 45*\sqrt{\sqrt{Strength*{q}Tusk}/10}</math>.

==Notes==
* Can be accidently used as a [[Bone Material]] or a [[Finebone]] in crafts if stored on a belt or inventory.

